# Graded spawn zones round Tempest (design/data/spawns.toml, life/mortal_spawns.js TtlSpawnZones): no natural hostile spawn
# in the town (r 150), a quarter of them out to r 400, the open wild beyond; Tempest's hard square (r 56) and the arrival's
# are unchanged. `ttl spawns zone` also prints how many natural spawns were refused since the start.
ttl spawns zone ${anchor:tempest}
ttl spawns expect ${anchor:tempest.x} ${anchor:tempest.z} none
ttl spawns expect ${anchor:tempest.x+140} ${anchor:tempest.z} none
ttl spawns expect ${anchor:tempest.x} ${anchor:tempest.z+200} reduced
ttl spawns expect ${anchor:tempest.x-390} ${anchor:tempest.z} reduced
ttl spawns expect ${anchor:tempest.x+420} ${anchor:tempest.z} open
ttl spawns expect ${anchor:arrival} open
